{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03730","headline":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制 · 李峤","name":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧宫贤相筑，新苑圣君来。\n运改城隍变，年深栋宇摧。\n後池无复水，前殿久成灰。\n莫辨祈风观，空传承露杯。\n宸心千载合，睿律九韶开。\n今日联章处，犹疑上柏台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}